[{"id":"addon:vile_darkness:vorpal_sword","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-36","title":"卡斯之剑","titleEn":"Vorpal Sword","rarity":"ultra","description":["令他难以置信的是，那把曾经用来夺取他力量的剑竟然出现在了他的面前，就在这个陌生的幻境。","· 进入驱散法球内的受伤逃生者会发出尖叫，并受到不治状态影响，持续30秒。","· 施展法师之手法术时，受法术作用的木板在4秒将被特殊破坏。","不治状态会使逃生者无法被治疗。"],"flavor":"“唯一一个挑战过我的，一生都将后悔这个选择。”——维克那","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_SwordOfKass.webp","glyph":4,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Vorpal_Sword","pinyin":"kasizhijian","initials":"kszj"},{"id":"addon:vile_darkness:iridescent_book_of_vile_darkness","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-36","title":"荧虹秽恶之书","titleEn":"Iridescent Book of Vile Darkness","rarity":"ultra","description":["残酷、邪恶和堕落终极集合。","·施展飞行法术时，经过的可翻越地点对逃生者封锁45秒。","·诅咒飞魂生成的飞行咒影数量减少3个，并且降低它们的飞行高度。"],"flavor":"“对抗我千年的修炼，你能有胜算么？”——维克那","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_IridescentBookOfVileDarkness.webp","glyph":5,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Iridescent_Book_of_Vile_Darkness","pinyin":"yinghonghuiezhishu","initials":"yhhezs"},{"id":"addon:vile_darkness:bag_of_holding","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-36","title":"次元袋","titleEn":"Bag of Holding","rarity":"very-rare","description":["整个幻境被惊人的力量笼罩，让对局内容更加丰富。","· 两个宝箱带有投掷结果一定为1的惩罚。","· 打开宝箱，会对逃生者施加15秒浑然不觉影响。","浑然不觉状态会使逃生者无法听到或受到杀手的恐惧范围影响。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_BagOfHolding.webp","glyph":6,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Bag_of_Holding","pinyin":"ciyuandai","initials":"cyd"},{"id":"addon:vile_darkness:robe_of_eyes","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-36","title":"百眼法袍","titleEn":"Robe of Eyes","rarity":"very-rare","description":["佩戴后，什么都逃脱不了你的“法眼”。","·每施展一次法术，宝箱6米范围内逃生者气场对你显示4秒。"],"flavor":"","icon":"/icons/IconAddon_RobeOfEyes.webp","glyph":7,"confidence":0.99,"source":"https://deadbydaylight.wiki.gg/wiki/Robe_of_Eyes","pinyin":"baiyanfapao","initials":"byfp"},{"id":"addon:vile_darkness:cloak_of_invisibility","kind":"addon","ownerId":"k-36","title":"隐身斗篷","titleEn":"Cloak of Invisibility","rarity":"very-rare